{title: Kahan Ho Tum}
{artist: Bombay Vikings}
{key: Bm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Bm]Kahan ho [G]tum mujhe [D]batao... [A],        [Bm]Zara [G]kareeb se [D]pukaro.. [A]
[Bm]Kahan [G]kahan dhundu [D]tumko.. [A],        [Em]Main aawara dar- [A]badar
Nazar na [Bm]aye tum [G]magar,        Chup [Em]gaye ho tum
[A]kaha ho tum [D]kidhar,        Ab to [Em]dil hai darta
[C]sehara dariya [G]aakhon ki [D]nami,        Yaadon [Em]ka laga hai
[C]pehra har [G]kahi.. [D],        Jana [Em]tum se tha jo
[C]roshan mera [G]pyar pe [D]yakeen,        Guum [Am]hai kahan kal
[F]tak to tha [C]yaheen,        Oh [Em]humnasheen
[Bm]Tumhine [G]to kaha tha [D]mujhse.. [A],        [Bm]Subha [G]nai to [D]aaegi.. [A]
[Bm]Isi [G]umeed ke [D]sahare.. [A],        [Em]Kar raha hu [A]rehguzar
Kaho [Bm]kahan ho [G]humsafar,        Chup [Em]gaye ho tum
[A]kaha ho tum [D]kidhar,        Ab to [Em]dil hai darta
[C]sehara dariya [G]aakhon ki [D]nami,        Yaadon [Em]ka laga hai
[C]pehra har [G]kahi.. [D],        Jana [Em]tum se tha jo
[C]roshan mera [G]pyar pe [D]yakeen,        Guum [Am]hai kahan kal
[F]tak to tha [C]yaheen,        Oh [Em]humnasheen
[A]Mujhe awaz do,        [A]Mere khawob ke saharon
[A]Phirse [Em]awaz [A]do,        [A]Kaha ho tum [Em]pukaron
[Em]Oh Mere [G]khawabon ke [Em]saharon,        [C]Oh [G]Mujhe tum [Em]pukaron
